{"title":"Brown Horse","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 10 Wildlife that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/horse-brown\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/horse-brown?lv=10\">Lv 10 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/horse-brown?lv=70\">Lv 70 <span>2</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/horse-brown?lv=10\" title=\"Pick level 10\"><td><b>10</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>31</td><td>10</td><td>500</td><td class=\"muted\">93 · 14 · 1,500</td><td>2</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/horse-brown\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>70</b></td><td>525</td><td>null</td><td>3,500</td><td class=\"muted\">1,575 · 0 · 10,500</td><td>2</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"horse-brown\" data-map-level=\"70\">Show level 70 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-528.0px,-83.9px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/1/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/1/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/2/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/2/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:0px\"><i style=\"left:528.0px;top:83.9px\"></i></div><figcaption>Plymouth Wharf</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Underleaf\">Underleaf</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"horse-brown\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Wildlife: <a href=\"#/monster/seagull\">Seagull</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rabbit\">Rabbit</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/chicken\">Chicken</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/frog\">Frog</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/arctic-hare\">Arctic Hare</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/crab\">Crab</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/deer\">Deer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/sheep\">Sheep</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/snow-fox\">Snow Fox</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/harbor-seal\">Harbor Seal</a> <span class=\"muted\">(3)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/horse-black\">Black Horse</a> <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/horse-white\">White Horse</a> <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/8a62b5876495ec9f9706.webp\" alt=\"Brown Horse\"></div><h3>Brown Horse</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>70</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 10)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Wildlife</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>525</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3,500</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>2 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}